: Estrutura m\u00ednima da pergunta no MVP", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "espec/docs/decisoes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "4 alternativas, 1 correta, justificativa obrigat\u00f3ria; espelha o padr\u00e3o do TAP."}, {"id": "espec_docs_decisoes_adr_0017", "label": "ADR-0017: Jobs agendados via scheduler in-process", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "espec/docs/decisoes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Zero infra extra; vi\u00e1vel por rodar 1 inst\u00e2ncia sempre-on no Fly.io."}, {"id": "espec_docs_decisoes_adr_0018", "label": "ADR-0018: Fronteira Better-Auth \u00d7 custom", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "espec/docs/decisoes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Better-Auth cobre base de identidade; sess\u00e3o \u00fanica, lockout e LGPD s\u00e3o l\u00f3gica pr\u00f3pria."}, {"id": "espec_docs_decisoes_adr_0019", "label": "ADR-0019: NFS-e fora do escopo do MVP", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "espec/docs/decisoes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Emiss\u00e3o de nota fiscal depende de CNPJ/regime ainda n\u00e3o definidos; fica manual/externa."}, {"id": "espec_docs_decisoes_adr_0020", "label": "ADR-0020: Backup PITR Neon + dump l\u00f3gico", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "espec/docs/decisoes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Dois n\u00edveis de backup a custo quase zero (R2 free tier) para dados com PII e financeiro."}, {"id": "espec_docs_decisoes_adr_0021", "label": "ADR-0021: M7 IA \u2014 escopo admin, PDFs selecion\u00e1veis", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "espec/docs/